@startuml 04b-seq
' 图 04B：control-plane schema admission 时序 — submit → approve → prepare → commit。

skinparam backgroundColor #FCFAF7
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ArrowColor #77716B
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F7F3EC

title 图 04B · Control-plane：schema admission 全链路时序
caption <color:#6E6963>案例 full-admission-prepare-commit：rev-001 → rev-002(+archive_artifact) · adm-full-001。抽象 04H。</color>

mainframe <b>治理纪律</b> · 单调扩展 · binding/head CAS · 分离 proposer/approver · prepare 须 FourViewEvidence
hide footbox

box "操作者" #F5F1EB
  actor "Author\nauthor" as Author
  actor "Proposer\nproposer" as Prop
  actor "Reviewer\nreviewer" as Rev
  actor "Operator\noperator" as Op
end box

box "FullControlPlaneService · engine/" #E5ECEE
  control "ControlPlaneService" as Svc
  control "controlPlaneWorker\nprepare/commit" as Worker
end box

box "G1 schema/ · G3 admission/" #EDE8F0
  control "monotoneExtensionValidator" as Ext
  database "ControlPlaneStore" as Store
end box

box "@cantilune/conformance" #EDE8F0
  control "ConformanceEvidenceVerifier" as Conf
end box

box "@cantilune/runtime" #E5ECEE
  control "RuntimeEpochAdministration" as Epoch
  database "CollaborationStore\nhead" as RStore
end box

box "横切" #F7F3EC
  queue "ControlPlaneOutbox" as Out
end box

== G1 · 注册候选 schema ==

Author -> Svc : registerSchemaRevision(rev-002)
activate Svc
Svc -> Store : registerRevision(candidate)
Svc --> Author : SchemaRevision
deactivate Svc

== G3 · submit：校验 binding + 单调扩展 ==

Prop -> Svc : submitSchemaAdmission(adm-full-001)
activate Svc
Svc -> Store : getActiveBinding(default)
Svc -> Store : getRevision(rev-001 · rev-002)
Svc -> Ext : computeMonotoneExtensionPlan
Ext --> Svc : SchemaExtensionPlan(+archive_artifact)
Svc -> Store : claimIdempotency(idem-full-001)
Svc -> Store : putAdmission(qualified/authorized)
Svc --> Prop : SchemaAdmissionRecord
deactivate Svc

== G3 · approve：分离职责 ==

Rev -> Svc : approveSchemaAdmission(adm-full-001)
activate Svc
Svc -> Store : getAdmission · canTransition → authorized
Svc --> Rev : authorized
deactivate Svc

== G4 · prepare：四视图 + runtime prepare ==

Op -> Svc : prepareSchemaAdmission(+fourViewEvidence)
activate Svc
Svc -> Conf : verifyFourViewEvidence(bundle)
Conf --> Svc : ok
Svc -> Epoch : prepareEpochTransition(planDigest)
Epoch -> RStore : inspect head · quiescence checks
Epoch --> Svc : PreparedEpochTransition
Svc -> Store : putAdmission(prepared)
Svc --> Op : PreparedSchemaAdmission
deactivate Svc

== G4 · commit：runtime commit + binding CAS ==

Op -> Svc : commitSchemaAdmission(prepared)
activate Svc
Svc -> Epoch : commitEpochTransition(prepared)
Epoch --> Svc : before/after SnapshotRef
Svc -> Store : casActiveBinding(gen 1→2)
Svc -> Store : putAdmission(committed)
Svc -> Out : enqueue(SchemaAdmissionCommitted)
Svc --> Op : SchemaAdmissionReceipt
deactivate Svc

note over Prop, Epoch #F7F3EC
  runtime 单步 execute（admit/commit Change）
  不在 control-plane；epoch 切换经 epochAdmin
end note

footer 状态机 04C · 类型 04A · 测试 full-admission-prepare-commit

@enduml
